1) THERE ARE SPELLS THAT ARE
ESSENTIAL TO SURVIVAL, SO THE FIRST
HINT IS DON'T PLAY A FIGHTER, THEY
CAN'T USE SPELLS!

2) DO NOT FIGHT POISON OR DISEASED
MONSTERS UNLESS YOU HAVE CAST A
RESIST POISON OR RESIST DISEASE
SPELL. THERE IS ALSO A RESIST DRAIN
SPELL, BUT NOTE THAT SOME MONSTERS
DRAIN BOTH LEVELS AND CHARACTERIS-
TICS.

3) POWER WEAPON IS A GREAT SPELL
WHICH IS OFTEN THE ONLY WAY TO KILL
A SHADOW MONSTER. A GOOD STRATEGY
TO PREPARE FOR BATTLE WITH A SHADOW
MONSTER IS TO CAST ALL OF YOUR
STRENGTH AND AGILITY SPELLS, AND
A RESIST LEVEL DRAIN, RESIST POISON
AND DISEASE, AND THEN A POWER
WEAPON SPELL.

