4) KEEP YOURSELF ALMOST ALL THE WAY
CURED, BUT DON'T CURE ALL THE WAY.
THAT WAY YOU WON'T WASTE ANY CUPS
OF HEALTH.

5) IF YOU ARE LOST, TRY NOT TO FIGHT
ANY MONSTERS IF YOU CAN AVOID IT.
YOU'LL NEED EVERYTHING YOU'VE GOT TO
SURVIVE.

6) YOU DIDN'T HEAR THIS FROM ME, BUT
IF YOU STEP ONE SQUARE AWAY FROM A
MONSTER, IT LOSES ITS INITIATIVE. IF
YOUR AGILITY IS VERY HIGH, YOU MAY
BE ABLE TO STRIKE AT A MONSTER AND
STEP BACK BEFORE IT CAN HIT YOU!

7) HIT 'CTRL-F' OR POINT TO FIGHT
AND HIT THE RIGHT MOUSE BUTTON FOR
ULTRA-HIGH SPEED BATTLE!

